{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"d6ea485f-2da5-49d2-aa1f-7854b0c820f3","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Open your compass wider than half AB. Without changing its width, draw arcs centered first at A, then at B.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"compass_arcs","on":"construction","marks":[{"kind":"arc","id":"arc_a","center":{"at":"a"},"r":3,"start":-65,"end":65,"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"arc","id":"arc_b","center":{"at":"b"},"r":3,"start":115,"end":245,"stroke":"dashed"}]},{"op":"text","id":"width_rule","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"content":"Same compass width for both centers"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"d6ea485f-2da5-49d2-aa1f-7854b0c820f3","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Mark the two arc crossings P and Q. Draw the straight line through them: this is the perpendicular bisector.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"bisector","on":"construction","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"p","at":[0,2.2360679775],"label":"P"},{"kind":"point","id":"q","at":[0,-2.2360679775],"label":"Q"},{"kind":"segment","id":"pq","from":[0,-3.1],"to":[0,3.1]}]},{"op":"equation","id":"equal_radii","anchor":{"el":"width_rule","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"PA=PB,\\qquad QA=QB"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"d6ea485f-2da5-49d2-aa1f-7854b0c820f3","step":{"id":"s4","script":"Both crossings are equally distant from A and B. Their line meets AB at its midpoint M, making a right angle.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"verify","on":"construction","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"m","at":{"hit":["ab","pq"]},"label":"M"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"m"},"from":{"at":"b"},"to":{"at":"p"},"r":0.18},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"a"},"to":{"at":"m"},"label":"d"},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"m"},"to":{"at":"b"},"label":"d"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"result","anchor":{"el":"equal_radii","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"AM=MB,\\qquad PQ\\perp AB"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Why must the compass width stay the same for both centers?","expected_gist":"Each arc crossing must be equally distant from A and B."}}}
